    "verdict": "fail",
    "issues": [
      "The play-cost reduction ability is encoded with timing \"fanfare\", but \"When playing this card ... this card costs 9 less to play\" must be a play-time cost-modification ability, not a Fanfare trigger. Encode it as a passive/while-in-hand-or-playing cost reduction gated by paying the banish cost.",
      "The printed keywords Storm, Bane, and Ward are duplicated in both `keywords` and a passive `passiveKeywords` ability; keep them only in `keywords`."
    ]
