        "cost": "2",
        "attack": "1",
        "defense": "2",
        "effect": "While there's another Machina follower on your field, this has Rush and Bane. [fanfare] If this wasn't put onto the field from hand, give it Assail. [lastwords] Discard 2 Machina cards: Put this into its owner's EX area and give it \"This costs 1 less to play.\""
      },
      "imgSrc": "/wordpress/wp-content/images/cardlist/BP17/BP17-079EN.png",
      "cardNos": [
        "BP17-079EN"
      ]
    },
    "previousParsed": {
      "keywords": [
        "fanfare",
        "rush"
      ],
      "abilities": [
        {
          "timing": "passive",
          "condition": {
            "type": "fieldTraitMin",
            "trait": "Machina",
            "count": 2
          },
          "effect": {
            "op": "passiveKeywords",
            "keywords": [
              "rush",
              "bane"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "timing": "fanfare",
          "effect": {
            "op": "if",
            "condition": {
              "type": "notEnteredFromHand"
            },
            "then": {
              "op": "grantKeyword",
              "keyword": "assail",
              "targets": {
                "type": "self"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "timing": "lastWords",
          "effect": {
            "op": "optionalCost",
            "label": "Discard 2 Machina cards",
            "cost": {
              "op": "discardFromHand",
              "filter": {
                "trait": "Machina"
              },
              "count": 2
            },
            "then": {
              "op": "sequence",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "op": "moveSourceToExArea"
                },
                {
                  "op": "grantPlayCostReduction",
                  "amount": 1,
                  "targets": {
                    "type": "self"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "parseConfidence": "high"
    },
    "verdict": "fail",
    "issues": [
      "The card has `keywords: [\"fanfare\", \"rush\"]`, but Fanfare is not a keyword and Rush is conditional rather than always printed. Remove these from `keywords` and keep the conditional Rush/Bane only in the passive ability.",
      "The Last Words cost reduction is applied to `targets: {\"type\":\"self\"}` after moving the card to EX area, but the source text gives the moved card in EX area \"This costs 1 less to play.\" Encode the reduction so it applies to this card in EX area / future plays of this card, not a field self-target buff."
    ]
  },
